A "craft kit" that allows you to make useful things.

apply to winter wolf cub corpse:
you get a "fur hat" with AC 9 and cold resistance

apply to giant beetle corpse:
you get a "giant beetle exoskeleton" with AC 6 or 7

apply to fire ant corpse:
you get a "fire ant exoskeleton" with AC 6 or 7 and fire resistance

apply to scorpion corpse:
you get a poison "scorpion barb" projectile

If rope golems leave "a bunch of string," you could make a leash from
it.

A new material, CHITIN, for exoskeletons.

and so on.

If you apply to a blessed object, there is a significant chance the
object will be enchanted.

"This exoskeleton turned out well."
"This exoskeleton turned out very well!"
"[your god] is pleased." (it's blessed too)

If applied to a cursed object, the attempt will probably fail,
consuming a charge.

"This isn't going very well. You give up."
you see "a failed craft project"

Dexterity improves craftsmanship.

